{"id":"nf11468472334","url":"https://www.dental-tribune.com/news/exocad-launches-exoplan-3-3-chemnitz-with-expanded-guide-design-options/","title":"Exocad launches exoplan 3.3 Chemnitz with expanded guide design options","source":"Dental Tribune","date":"2026-11-26T08:54:22.000Z","byline":"exocad","image":"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/39be7c2e/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz0xNjA7aD0xNjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1naWYp/wp-content/themes/dt/images/company-photo.gif","imageKind":"","imageBg":"","html":"<img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/39be7c2e/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz0xNjA7aD0xNjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1naWYp/wp-content/themes/dt/images/company-photo.gif\" alt=\"exocad\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p>exocad</p> <p>Thu. 26. November 2026</p> share save <h2><p>DARMSTADT, Germany: Exocad, an Align Technology company and a provider of CAD software for dental applications, has announced the release of exoplan 3.3 Chemnitz, the latest version of its implant planning software. The release introduces new features for designing stackable and bone-supported surgical guides as well as workflow improvements intended to accelerate implant planning. The new guide composer and its automation tools allow dental professionals to tailor surgical guides to individual patient anatomy and help reduce planning time.</p>\n</h2> <p>Key updates in exoplan 3.3 Chemnitz include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>expanded surgical guide design options, including tooth-, gingiva- and bone-supported guides as well as stackable and bone reduction guides;</li>\n<li>a new jawbone reduction feature for planning targeted bone reduction to facilitate implant placement;</li>\n<li>a guide composer that provides automated suggestions for combining prosthetic, bone reduction, fixation and surgical guides;</li>\n<li>initial positioning of multiple implants in a single click and options for parallel or mirrored implant positioning;</li>\n<li>template-based all-on-X implant planning, enabling initial implant positioning for full-arch restorations in a single click;</li>\n<li>one-click segmentation of jawbone data from CBCT images to create detailed 3D models for implant planning and bone reduction, including the option of manual refinement;</li>\n<li>new automation features for CT-to-mesh alignment; and</li>\n<li>automated extraction of the gingival contact surface from dentures using CBCT and optical scans of the prosthesis, without the need for an intra-oral scan or analogue impression.</li>\n</ul> <ul><picture><source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/c0c2de41/cmVzaXplKHc9MTYwMDtoPTYwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 1600w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/bf1b0a99/cmVzaXplKHc9ODAwO2g9MzAwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 800w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/c69effd4/cmVzaXplKHc9MTIwMDtoPTQ1MCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 1200w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/921ce851/cmVzaXplKHc9MjQwMDtoPTkwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 2400w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/6d6d8c4b/cmVzaXplKHc9MzIwMDtoPTEyMDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 3200w\" type=\"image/webp\"> <source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d935ccef/cmVzaXplKHc9MTYwMDtoPTYwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXBuZyk/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 1600w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/18a41226/cmVzaXplKHc9ODAwO2g9MzAwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9cG5nKQ/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 800w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/81a83ab8/cmVzaXplKHc9MTIwMDtoPTQ1MCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXBuZyk/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 1200w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/9f1877e1/cmVzaXplKHc9MjQwMDtoPTkwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXBuZyk/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 2400w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d3224a6d/cmVzaXplKHc9MzIwMDtoPTEyMDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1wbmcp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png 3200w\" type=\"image/png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d3224a6d/cmVzaXplKHc9MzIwMDtoPTEyMDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1wbmcp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_2.png\" alt=\"Exoplan 3.3 Chemnitz introduces new features for designing stackable and bone reduction guides. \" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t</picture>Exoplan 3.3 Chemnitz introduces new features for designing stackable and bone reduction guides. <picture><source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/c069ebef/cmVzaXplKHc9MTYwMDtoPTYwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_3.png 1600w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/cb5612b3/cmVzaXplKHc9ODAwO2g9MzAwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_3.png 800w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/ce986139/cmVzaXplKHc9MTIwMDtoPTQ1MCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_3.png 1200w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/9cd20c81/cmVzaXplKHc9MjQwMDtoPTkwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_3.png 2400w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/2ffdc36e/cmVzaXplKHc9MzIwMDtoPTEyMDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_3.png 3200w\" type=\"image/webp\"> <source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/94058258/cmVza