xocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png 1200w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/0b4dcfeb/cmVzaXplKHc9MjQwMDtoPTkwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png 2400w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/997cf675/cmVzaXplKHc9MzIwMDtoPTEyMDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png 3200w\" type=\"image/webp\"> <source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/97c0091e/cmVzaXplKHc9MTYwMDtoPTYwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXBuZyk/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png 1600w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/8602bb36/cmVzaXplKHc9ODAwO2g9MzAwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9cG5nKQ/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png 800w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d90e446f/cmVzaXplKHc9MTIwMDtoPTQ1MCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXBuZyk/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png 1200w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/c2eb4dae/cmVzaXplKHc9MjQwMDtoPTkwMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXBuZyk/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png 2400w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/16bcc19e/cmVzaXplKHc9MzIwMDtoPTEyMDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1wbmcp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png 3200w\" type=\"image/png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/16bcc19e/cmVzaXplKHc9MzIwMDtoPTEyMDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1wbmcp/up/dt/2026/11/Exocad-launches-exoplan-3.3-Chemnitz_4.png\" alt=\"The template-based all-on-X solution enables initial implant positioning for full-arch restorations in a single click.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t</picture>The template-based all-on-X solution enables initial implant positioning for full-arch restorations in a single click. </ul>\n\t<p>Exoplan 3.3 Chemnitz is now available in the EU and other selected markets. The software is part of the Align Digital Platform, Align Technology’s integrated suite of digital technologies and services for dental professionals, laboratories, partners and patients. Additional information about exocad’s latest software release is available at <a href=\"https://exocad.com/exoplan-chemnitz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">exocad.com/exoplan-chemnitz</a>.</p> <p><strong>Editorial note:</strong></p> <p>Exocad names its releases after European Capitals of Culture and selected the city of Chemnitz in Germany for its current release cycle.</p>","kind":"full"}